{"seq":3,"slug":"alert-fatigue-unsubscribe-guardrail","title":"提醒疲劳、退订率护栏与增量实验度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/wishlist-restock-price-alert-engagement/conversion-merchandising-ops/alert-fatigue-unsubscribe-guardrail","wordCount":3083,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"提醒疲劳-退订率护栏与增量实验度量\">提醒疲劳、退订率护栏与增量实验度量</h1><p>前两章解决的是「一封提醒要不要发、怎么送达」；这一章处理发出之后的事：当同一用户被反复触达，边际收益会衰减，而负面效应（退订、投诉、卸载、关闭通知权限）会累积且<strong>不可逆</strong>。库存回补类提醒的时效极短，运营天然有把频率往上推的冲动；但退订是一次性的、几乎无法挽回的资产损失，并且会同时污染该用户在<strong>所有</strong>主题上的触达面。因此「提醒系统」的度量体系必须包含一条负向护栏，而不是只看点击与转化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>这一章把「该不该发」拆成两套必须同时成立的判据。**护栏（guardrail）**是负向约束，回答「最多能发多少」——由退订率、投诉率、渠道禁用率等不可逆负面事件定义，触发后自动降级或熔断。<strong>增量（incrementality）<strong>是正向判据，回答「发了究竟多赚多少」——只能由随机对照给出，点击后转化会因选择偏差系统性高估。两者不可互替：正增量但退订率过阈值的策略净效应为负，因为退订削减的是</strong>未来所有批次</strong>的触达基数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"提醒疲劳的机制与可测代理指标\">提醒疲劳的机制与可测代理指标</h2><p>疲劳不是「用户烦了」这种主观描述，而是可观测的响应衰减曲线。对一批同时订阅同一 SKU 的用户，把第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次触达的点击率记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CTR_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，多数品类的曲线呈现先缓后陡的下降，且下降的拐点因品类、价格带与触达间隔而异。真正需要工程化的问题是：<strong>在拐点之后每多发一次，收益已低于它对退订与投诉的边际贡献</strong>，此时发送是净负的。</p>\n<p>由于「疲劳」本身不可直接测量，系统必须用一组**代理指标（proxy metrics）**来逼近它，并区分「领先指标」（先动，用于预警）与「滞后指标」（后动，用于追责）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>健康区间（行业经验值）</th>\n<th>危险信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>退订率</td>\n<td>7 日退订数 / 7 日送达数</td>\n<td>滞后</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.5%（促销类偏高）</td>\n<td>单批次 &gt; 1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投诉率</td>\n<td>举报为垃圾邮件数 / 送达数</td>\n<td>滞后</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.1%</td>\n<td>逼近 0.3%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推送禁用率</td>\n<td>关闭渠道用户数 / 送达数</td>\n<td>滞后</td>\n<td>&lt; 1%</td>\n<td>环比翻倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触达频次</td>\n<td>每人每日/每周送达条数</td>\n<td>领先</td>\n<td>依品类定，常见 ≤ 2/日</td>\n<td>长尾用户被高频命中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度点击率</td>\n<td>点击且停留 &gt; 阈值的比例</td>\n<td>领先</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>点击率持平时深度点击下滑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通知权限关闭</td>\n<td>系统级 opt-out 增量</td>\n<td>滞后</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>与频次正相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卸载/沉默</td>\n<td>7 日无会话用户增量</td>\n<td>滞后</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>与频次同步上升</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>0.3% 这条线不是经验值而是平台硬约束：Google 自 2024 年 2 月起对大批量发件人（日发量 5,000 封以上）要求垃圾邮件投诉率<strong>持续低于 0.3%</strong>，同时须通过 SPF/DKIM 认证并配置 DMARC，否则投递会被降级或拒绝（来源：Gmail 大批量发件人指南，<a href=\"https://support.google.com/a/answer/81126）。投诉率是**用户主动举报**，而用户举报前通常先经历一段「不点但也不退订」的沉默期——这正是为什么必须用领先指标做预警，而不能等投诉率抬升才反应。\">https://support.google.com/a/answer/81126）。投诉率是**用户主动举报**，而用户举报前通常先经历一段「不点但也不退订」的沉默期——这正是为什么必须用领先指标做预警，而不能等投诉率抬升才反应。</a></p>\n<p>频次指标要按<strong>用户粒度</strong>看分布而非均值。均值 1.2 条/日完全可以隐藏一支「每天收到 6 条」的长尾，而这支长尾贡献了绝大部分退订。正确的视图是 P50 / P90 / P99 的分位分布，并单独盯住 P99 人群的退订率——护栏触发的判断依据应落在尾部，而不是平均数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"退订率护栏-阈值-分级熔断与状态机\">退订率护栏：阈值、分级熔断与状态机</h2><p>护栏（guardrail）与业务指标的本质区别是：业务指标差只是「没赚到」，护栏被击穿意味着「已经亏了且可能持续亏」。因此护栏必须有<strong>自动的、可回退的制动</strong>，并且它的判定窗口要短到能在损失扩大前生效。</p>\n<p>一个可落地的设计是三级状态机，把「观察 → 降级 → 熔断」显式建模，并对每一级定义恢复条件（避免降级后永不回正）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  N[NORMAL&lt;br/&gt;正常发送] --&gt;|退订率 30min 窗口 &gt; 阈值| W[WATCH&lt;br/&gt;降频 + 告警]&#10;  W --&gt;|窗口回落且持续 2 窗| N&#10;  W --&gt;|退订率 90min 窗口 &gt; 高危阈值&lt;br/&gt;或投诉率 &gt; 0.3%| T[THROTTLE&lt;br/&gt;只保留事务性&lt;br/&gt;营销类暂停]&#10;  T --&gt;|投诉率回落至 0.1% 以下&lt;br/&gt;且人工确认| W&#10;  T --&gt;|投诉率 &gt; 0.5%&lt;br/&gt;或收到平台告警| H[HALT&lt;br/&gt;点击限流&lt;br/&gt;仅投递退订确认]&#10;  H --&gt;|根因修复&lt;br/&gt;+ 分层重开小流量| W\">flowchart TD\n  N[NORMAL&lt;br/&gt;正常发送] --&gt;|退订率 30min 窗口 &gt; 阈值| W[WATCH&lt;br/&gt;降频 + 告警]\n  W --&gt;|窗口回落且持续 2 窗| N\n  W --&gt;|退订率 90min 窗口 &gt; 高危阈值&lt;br/&gt;或投诉率 &gt; 0.3%| T[THROTTLE&lt;br/&gt;只保留事务性&lt;br/&gt;营销类暂停]\n  T --&gt;|投诉率回落至 0.1% 以下&lt;br/&gt;且人工确认| W\n  T --&gt;|投诉率 &gt; 0.5%&lt;br/&gt;或收到平台告警| H[HALT&lt;br/&gt;点击限流&lt;br/&gt;仅投递退订确认]\n  H --&gt;|根因修复&lt;br/&gt;+ 分层重开小流量| W</pre><p>关键设计点有三。其一，<strong>窗口要短</strong>：退订与投诉的检测窗口应取分钟级到小时级（例如 30/90 分钟滚动窗口），因为发信批次是成批到达的，等待「日粒度报表」意味着几百万封已发出。其二，<strong>分级要单调</strong>：进入降级只降频率、不越权停掉法律必需的事务性邮件（如退订确认本身，必须始终可投递）。其三，<strong>恢复要有证据</strong>：从 THROTTLE 回到 WATCH 需要指标持续回落，而不是单窗抖动——单窗回正往往只是批次间隔造成的空档。</p>\n<p>阈值本身不应是全局常量，而应按<strong>主题 × 渠道 × 用户分层</strong>设定。同样的退订率，对「降价提醒」这类可选主题是危险信号，对「订单状态」这类事务性通知则近乎不可能出现。一个常用的相对口径是计算每层的基线并设相对阈值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>baseline</mtext><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>β</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{k,c} = \\beta \\cdot \\text{baseline}_{k,c}, \\qquad \\beta \\in [1.5,\\,3]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">baseline</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是主题、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是渠道，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>baseline</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{baseline}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span> 取该层过去 8 周的稳健中位数（避免被历史事件抬高）。相对阈值让新主题上线时无需凭直觉拍绝对值，护栏随基线自适应。</p>\n<p>熔断还与合规强相关。美国 CAN-SPAM 要求商业邮件提供可用退订机制并在 <strong>10 个工作日</strong>内生效（来源：FTC CAN-SPAM 合规指南，<a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/can-spam-act-compliance-guide-business）；Gmail/Yahoo\">https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/can-spam-act-compliance-guide-business）；Gmail/Yahoo</a> 更进一步要求大批量发件人支持 RFC 8058 定义的 <strong>List-Unsubscribe-Post 一键退订</strong>（来源：RFC 8058，<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8058）。这意味着退订入口不能藏在需要登录的多级菜单里——一键退订的转化率远高于传统入口，护栏上看到的退订率抬升，一部分其实是**退订摩擦下降**带来的真实信号显性化，而非用户变烦了。解读这类指标跳变时，必须先排除工具变更带来的口径位移。\">https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8058）。这意味着退订入口不能藏在需要登录的多级菜单里——一键退订的转化率远高于传统入口，护栏上看到的退订率抬升，一部分其实是**退订摩擦下降**带来的真实信号显性化，而非用户变烦了。解读这类指标跳变时，必须先排除工具变更带来的口径位移。</a></p>\n<p>在欧盟语境下，护栏还有一层不可忽视的义务：GDPR 第 21 条赋予数据主体<strong>随时反对</strong>基于直接营销的处理的绝对权利，反对生效后发送即违法，且不以退订按钮为前提（来源：GDPR 第 21 条，<a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/art-21-gdpr/；同意要件见第\">https://gdpr-info.eu/art-21-gdpr/；同意要件见第</a> 4(11) 条与 CJEU C-673/17 Planet49 判决）。因此「退订 / 反对 / 关闭类别」必须归并进同一份同意投影，护栏读取的是<strong>投影后</strong>的资格状态，而非各渠道各自为政的开关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"增量实验-holdout-cuped-与归因陷阱\">增量实验：holdout、CUPED 与归因陷阱</h2><p>「提醒带来了多少转化」这个问题，用点击后购买（click-through conversion）回答会系统性高估，因为点击提醒的人本来就更可能购买——这是选择偏差，不是因果效应。唯一可靠的答案是<strong>随机对照</strong>：把符合触发条件的用户按哈希分成处理组与对照组，对照组不发提醒，两组的转化差就是增量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>incremental lift</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mtext>treated</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mtext>control</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mtext>control</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{incremental lift} = \\frac{Y_{\\text{treated}} - Y_{\\text{control}}}{Y_{\\text{control}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">incremental lift</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">control</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">treated</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">control</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对照组必须<strong>满足触发条件但不发</strong>，否则测的是「谁订阅了提醒」而非「提醒的效果」。一个常见错误是把全体用户当对照——两者基线差异巨大，算出来的「提升」毫无意义。</p>\n<p>保留一定的永久 holdout（例如 5%）是另一种做法：它不服务单次实验，而是给整个系统一个长期的<strong>反事实基线</strong>，用以回答「如果完全关掉提醒，业务会少多少」。代价是这 5% 用户长期收不到通知，需与合规和用户预期平衡——通常做法是从「新订阅者」里抽取 holdout，避免剥夺已有订阅者的既有权益。</p>\n<p>实验的灵敏度可以用方差缩减技术提升。CUPED（Controlled-experiment Using Pre-Experiment Data）用实验前的协变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>（如用户前 30 天 GMV）来吸收结果变量的方差（来源：Deng、Xu、Kohavi、Walker，WSDM 2013，<a href=\"https://www.exp-platform.com/Documents/2013-02-CUPED-ImprovingSensitivityOfControlledExperiments.pdf）：\">https://www.exp-platform.com/Documents/2013-02-CUPED-ImprovingSensitivityOfControlledExperiments.pdf）：</a></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mtext>cuped</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_{\\text{cuped}} = Y - \\theta\\,(X - \\bar{X}), \\qquad \\theta = \\frac{\\operatorname{Cov}(Y, X)}{\\operatorname{Var}(X)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cuped</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0701em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">Cov</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span> 相关性高时，方差可下降 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\rho^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，意味着同样的样本量能检测到更小的效应。对提醒系统尤其有用，因为触发事件（某 SKU 补货）本身是低频且随机的，单次实验样本不足。</p>\n<p>三个必须防的陷阱：<strong>样本比例失衡（SRM）</strong>——分流哈希实现有偏会使两组样本量偏离预期，用卡方检验守住，一旦显著即作废该实验；<strong>偷看（peeking）</strong>——按固定显著性阈值反复检验会抬高假阳率，需用序贯检验或预设固定时长；<strong>多重比较</strong>——同时测多个指标与分层时须做 Bonferroni 或 FDR 校正，否则「显著性」是挑出来的。</p>\n<p>与护栏的关系是：增量实验回答「该不该发」，护栏回答「能发多少」。两者必须联动——一个带来正增量但把退订率推过阈值的实验，其净效应为负，因为退订会削减<strong>未来所有批次</strong>的触达基数。度量上应把退订折算进目标函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>net value</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>contribution</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>unsub</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>LTV</mtext><mtext>future</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{net value} = \\Delta \\text{contribution} - \\lambda \\cdot \\Delta \\text{unsub} \\cdot \\text{LTV}_{\\text{future}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net value</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">contribution</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">unsub</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LTV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">future</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是风险厌恶系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>LTV</mtext><mtext>future</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LTV}_{\\text{future}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LTV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">future</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是退订用户本可贡献的剩余生命周期价值。这个式子把「护栏不是道德约束而是经济约束」显式化：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 取真实 LTV 时，很多高频策略的净值为负。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量的口径纪律与决策闭环\">度量的口径纪律与决策闭环</h2><p>指标本身可以被做假，护栏的设计必须预设运营有把数字做好看的动机。三条口径纪律能挡住大部分自欺：<strong>分母统一</strong>（退订率、投诉率一律以「送达数」为分母，而非「发送意图数」，否则抑制与失败会让分母虚高、比率虚低）；<strong>归因窗口预设</strong>（库存类提醒的转化本就集中在数小时内，点击归因窗口应设为短窗如 24 小时，长窗会把自然购买算进功劳）；<strong>口径变更留痕</strong>（任何分母、窗口、去重规则的调整都要在数据字典里记版本与生效时间，否则实验前后不可比）。</p>\n<p>决策闭环上，一份能用的看板应把三个数放在同一行：<strong>增量</strong>（holdout 差值）、<strong>频率</strong>（P90 触达条数）、<strong>护栏</strong>（状态机当前级别）。任何一次「提高频率」的提案，都必须同时给出这三个数的预期走向；只报增量不报护栏的提案不予通过。</p>\n<p>本章其余文档见章节入口 <a href=\"./\">转化、商品运营与度量</a>；投递前的渠道与频次预算建模见 <a href=\"../notification-delivery-realtime/channel-preference-quiet-hours-model\">通知渠道、用户偏好与静默时段建模</a>，触发条件的时效分级见 <a href=\"../restock-price-alert-engine/alert-trigger-condition-model\">提醒触发条件建模</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>疲劳是可观测的衰减曲线</strong>，用代理指标逼近；领先指标（频次、深度点击）用于预警，滞后指标（退订、投诉、卸载）用于追责。</li>\n<li><strong>投诉率 0.3% 是平台硬线</strong>（Gmail 大批量发件人要求），护栏必须在它之前用更快的信号制动。</li>\n<li><strong>频次看尾部分布</strong>（P90/P99），不看均值——退订集中在被高频命中的长尾。</li>\n<li><strong>护栏用三级状态机 + 短窗 + 相对阈值</strong>；降级不越权停事务性邮件，恢复需持续证据而非单窗抖动。</li>\n<li><strong>增量只能靠随机对照</strong>：对照组须满足触发条件但不发；配合 CUPED 降方差，用 SRM 检验、固定时长、多重比较校正守住有效性。</li>\n<li><strong>退订必须折进目标函数</strong>：净价值须扣减被消耗的未来 LTV，护栏是经济约束而非道德约束。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"提醒疲劳、退订率护栏与增量实验度量","id":"提醒疲劳-退订率护栏与增量实验度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"提醒疲劳的机制与可测代理指标","id":"提醒疲劳的机制与可测代理指标"},{"level":2,"text":"退订率护栏：阈值、分级熔断与状态机","id":"退订率护栏-阈值-分级熔断与状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"增量实验：holdout、CUPED 与归因陷阱","id":"增量实验-holdout-cuped-与归因陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"度量的口径纪律与决策闭环","id":"度量的口径纪律与决策闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"提醒驱动的商品运营与个性化提示排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/wishlist-restock-price-alert-engagement/conversion-merchandising-ops/alert-driven-merchandising-ranking"},"next":null}